2026-11-06T02:59:24.6827603Z 
2026-11-06T02:59:24.6828307Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-11-06T02:59:24.6828950Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-11-06T02:59:24.6829468Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-11-06T02:59:24.6829955Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-11-06T02:59:24.6830132Z 
2026-11-06T02:59:24.6830294Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-11-06T02:59:24.6830521Z 
2026-11-06T02:59:24.6830700Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-11-06T02:59:24.6831045Z    can use Nix.
2026-11-06T02:59:24.6831172Z 
2026-11-06T02:59:24.6831279Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
