2026-11-06T02:59:24.6841477Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T02:59:24.6841645Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T02:59:24.6841815Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T02:59:24.6842041Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T02:59:24.6842254Z    /root
2026-11-06T02:59:24.6851637Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T02:59:24.6852103Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T02:59:24.6861041Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T02:59:24.6861324Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T02:59:24.6861472Z 
